## Summary

**The Extension Pattern**:
1. Core stays in `django-core/` repo (80% foundation)
2. Your product in separate repo (20% domain logic)
3. Install core as dependency (pip/pnpm)
4. Extend with ForeignKeys, custom endpoints, UI components
5. Follow core patterns for auth, permissions, multi-tenancy
6. Test using core fixtures and utilities
7. Update core regularly, following migration guides

**Result**: Production-grade SaaS with 80% handled by core, 20% custom logic, clean separation, easy updates.
